{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e75687313352899ff05b48ab72a5707a3f4d2ea88451540f1717ec726f79c439", "ja": "（ようやく仕事がひと山越えた……\nさすがに疲れたな。ちょっとだけ、休憩を……）", "zh": "（总算忙过一阵了……\n果然还是挺累的。稍微休息一下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1001_se", "source_sha256": "8b54693877ee97a09c9e25bb1b7c52bccb1efbad61749fe01c681d50081f43ce", "ja": "ガチャ……", "zh": "咔嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "b136bda85f4c55d17f233eb7a5eb0458b6c23528a1f8e4c32ddc2ffb8ff2d1f7", "ja": "……！\n{$P$}、さん……？", "zh": "……！\n{$P$}……先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a0fc43fe889b304d6d772dfde3c312fd4a04b25910be776fdf9b34628f4e6ca8", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、杏奈か。悪い、寝ちゃってて\n気がつかなかったよ。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "咦？……啊，是杏奈啊。抱歉，我睡着了，没注意到你。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "2fadbc39767bc0444d381f7df8e0bf77496b241427f7ba9b4f2ed3876b659ff4", "ja": "……、よかった……です。", "zh": "……太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "d3ee12a6a2c8722e25a77e723b33bfbcde6652f4a6634cd83fd675e3bc9289cc", "ja": "{$P$}さん、動かないから……。\n人形に……なっちゃったかと、思った……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生一动不动的……\n杏奈还以为……你变成人偶了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3327d8b34ad5e460c7c3437cb5d4205f036099a20fde6f2ec1a97dc67aa1c1b8", "ja": "人形？　ああ、じっとしてたからか。\nビックリさせてごめんな。", "zh": "人偶？啊，因为我一直一动不动，所以你才这么想吧。\n吓到你了，真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "257b901284dc249d663434b5e413633236dbcb4fd16db1a4c37d8fe00d6e6e05", "ja": "ううん……。\nよかった、です。", "zh": "不会……\n太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "16f8d9e9de9ac426a6b9c1192dd75761c30b826ed852f7f9b9277b91c5bf2671", "ja": "……人形じゃ、ない……よね？", "zh": "……不是、人偶……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b6986aa3131cf96202cdd2de1186dca1ee0cd71d04ada8816aeb8a79c15e4a54", "ja": "（そういえば、みんなで\n人形になる夢を見たって言ってたもんな）", "zh": "（说起来，大家之前都说过自己做了变成人偶的梦来着。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a05591b23abdfe5efdd84b2541915fc75cf61ce9584146bbdd4446337a161b9f", "ja": "不安なら、確かめてみるか？", "zh": "如果不安的话，要不要确认一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "5267baca347f415c0245639d19a50491294860b3a3664543c688acbfa766d8ee", "ja": "……いいの？\nじゃあ……ちょっとだけ。", "zh": "……可以吗？\n那……就摸一下下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1013_se", "source_sha256": "f4e5992b2b5b09bc0bb35111911450230c34705032e5b2bef3ffd6f03324bdbc", "ja": "……フニフニ", "zh": "……软乎乎的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "21d0360bb729ce95cffaf4bee216cce36e4c13dae651bd4092b550aca464e53b", "ja": "……、ほんとだ。\n{$P$}さん、人間……だね。", "zh": "……，真的。\n{$P$}先生，是人类……呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1849878863a835d42a39051c36cc599841a5ee6658c6aa71604f84d18dd61d51", "ja": "ああ。安心できたか？", "zh": "啊。放心了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "01493f4821c41d14e2b56377603ae812f16de5d3bf89f77372c7beabc805879b", "ja": "うん。……大丈夫。\n安心、しました。", "zh": "嗯。……没事了。\n我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3a9adb099b50035b638695248657c5154f8cdeaffe74ff1d40e66c8749001acd", "ja": "それならよかった。そうだ、みんな宛てに\n例のブランドからお礼が届いてたんだ。", "zh": "那就好。对了，那个品牌还寄来了给大家的谢礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "a05aefab1eefd057d4f956b1c44cfcdb1b48af22b91e7e6463a2d76f6a3466ea", "ja": "え、お礼？　なんだろ♪", "zh": "诶，感谢？会是什么呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1019_p", "source_sha256": "69ac2982f45122a40df522c618453ff9cd94f00fe60f74f648320e842d1252b4", "ja": "『先日はありがとうございました。\nイベントも大好評で、弊社一同大変感激しております』", "zh": "『前些日子承蒙关照。\n活动也大获好评，我们全体员工都深受感动』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1020_p", "source_sha256": "709824ee70f09fe94a33e490c8d4e80db05538dfaba8e80689cf5e67f6c8bf21", "ja": "『お礼に、Chrono-Lexicaの皆さんの\nドールを制作いたしましたので、お届けします』　……", "zh": "『为了表达谢意，我们特意制作了Chrono-Lexica\n各位的人偶，现给您送去』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "e5c6340ce88025c0ef34245c07ead8b13cbf2808209547a70f4c5f0e3825d2e1", "ja": "『先日のイベントと同じ衣装を着用しております。\nぜひ可愛がってあげてください』　……", "zh": "『穿着和前几天活动时一样的服装。\n请一定要好好疼爱它们』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "82b9829becc3a120fa8237ee970bbefc1b40bd115530e1f3e4406249fc07ab80", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nこれって……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n这个是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1023_p", "source_sha256": "b698a134221bde563b175f15ea19bd43bd8c3393ed0248381ba19136caf6bd1f", "ja": "道理で、大きな箱だと思った……。\nけど、これは……。", "zh": "难怪我觉得箱子这么大……。可是，这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "c249f0416ab4a371cbfad143c6bc991a8045b5b7024a6195a22fe91f2d2201ef", "ja": "……、{$P$}さん……\n箱、開けるの……？", "zh": "……、{$P$}先生……要打开箱子吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1025_p", "source_sha256": "37e41bd12626d22120ad9d19399a3846cad1a9c1ee3af1ea2eda25d9d5a9b7d2", "ja": "いや……ちょっと待とう。Chrono-Lexica\n全員分あるみたいだし、揃ってる時の方がいいかも。", "zh": "不……先等等吧。好像\nChrono-Lexica全员的份都在，等大家齐了再开可能比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "bd1c665a25b85d2f5c27053aca3df09a4e0d5cb9a455025c65b6b5f1f85e8538", "ja": "そう……だね。うん。\n杏奈も、そのほうがいいと思う……。", "zh": "是……对。嗯。\n杏奈也觉得那样比较好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "390736556847f50ff2de72c6554bcf7c23f299435a446b823492e2246cb78a4b", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。杏奈たち、\nお人形になっちゃったら、どうしよう……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。安奈她们要是变成玩偶了，该怎么办……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1028_p", "source_sha256": "7bb5206f59f653d84c9124761e2438b4528b2890d0aa7f2b7ad48e87b30ade9d", "ja": "いや、それは絶対にないから大丈夫だ！\nひとまず、みんなに連絡してみるか……。", "zh": "不会，那种事绝对不可能发生的，放心吧！\n先试着联络一下大家吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0673_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a616945e3ecc061940a01439eb192c756851fe1a8b3a7f24efb30c8753217ffc", "ja": "（人形は後日、メンバー全員が揃った時に開封した。\n普通の人形だったけど、何だか変に緊張したな……）", "zh": "（人偶后来等成员们全部到齐后才打开。虽然只是普通的人偶，但总觉得莫名有些紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
